//! The `mask-position` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets the
//! initial position, relative to the mask position layer set by `mask-origin`, for each defined mask
//! image.
//!
//! Initial: 0% 0%. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to size of mask painting area minus size of mask layer image (see the text for
//! `background-position`).
//!
